### Task 1 design

Hardware config (STM32F407VET6 / RoboMaster C板):
- LED: TIM3_CH1 → PA6 (TIM3_CH1 also on PC6, PB4). Use PA6. Or use PD12 (F407 discovery green LED) with TIM4_CH1 (PD12 = TIM4_CH1). I'll pick TIM3_CH1 PA6 with a comment.
- Breathing engine: TIM6 (basic timer) update interrupt @ 1 kHz → updates __HAL_TIM_SET_COMPARE. Breathing: duty = f(t) triangle/sine. Frequency = breath period variable in ms.
- CAN1: PA11/PA12 (RX/TX) with TJA1050/SN65HVD230 transceiver, 120Ω termination.
- USART1: PA9/PA10 with DMA2 Stream2/7 for F407 (USART1_RX → DMA2 Stream2 Channel4; USART1_TX → DMA2 Stream7 Channel4). For F103: DMA1 Channel5/4.
- VOFA via USB-TTL on USART1.

