Frame protocol: header 0xAA, tail 0x55; data[1] cmd; check header/footer, maybe checksum. Let's define: data[0]=0xAA frame head, data[7]=0x55 frame tail, data[1]=cmd, data[2..5]=value (float or uint32), data[6]=checksum = sum(data[1..5]) & 0xFF.

